The enhanced Graph RAG pipeline involves selecting the most contextually relevant chunks and community reports from the constructed knowledge graph to answer user queries efficiently. By leveraging local and global RAG strategies, the system identifies key entities, communities, and their relationships, then ranks and filters potential matches against the user's prompt [
[21](#bib.bib21)
