Alignment has become a critical step towards ensuring large language model (LLM) responses align with general human preferences . Currently, alignment algorithms are dominated by reinforcement learning-based schemes-such as RLHF (
[Ouyang et al. 2022](#bib.bib48)
) and the more efficient direct preference optimization (DPO) (
